# SEALED heldout split (AD-13).
#
# This directory holds the sealed evaluation set. It is NEVER consumed by any routine CI
# job in ci.yml or canary.yml. The benchmark runner refuses to touch it without an explicit
# --gate-exit flag, and only a manually-dispatched gate-exit workflow (added at first phase
# exit) may pass that flag. Do NOT add a CI glob that sweeps this path.
#
# Future contents: sha256 MANIFEST + a SEALED marker file.
